    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Fluxus Events (Music)",
      "links": [],
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Opera Instruction\n\n\n\nAn occurrence or part of an occurrence is recorded and played\nback.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Eric Andersen, 1961",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Opera Instruction\n\n\n\nThe following frequencies are played as piano frequencies: (all\nC's simultaneously on the piano, etc.) C - D flat - D - E flat\n- E - F - G flat - G - A flat - A - B flat - B",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Eric Andersen, 1961",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Piece for Ben Patterson\n\n\n\nConstruct a piano with the treble on the left ascending to\nthe bass on the right. Play all the old favorite classics.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Albert M. Fine, Date unknown",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Opera Instruction\n\n\n\n1 Select some objects which address themselves to your acoustic\nimagination.\n\n2 Play with them according to a predetermined system.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Eric Andersen, 1961",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Kompo\n\n\n\nConductor wraps his baton with paper and string. Performers wrap\ntheir instruments.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Genpei Akasegawa, Date unknown",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Danger Music Number Seventeen\n\n\n\nScream! Scream! Scream! Scream! Scream! Scream!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Dick Higgins, May 1962",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sanitas No. 151\n\n\n\n250 nails are hammered.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Tomas Schmit, Date unknown",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sanitas No. 151, Fluxvariation 1\n\n\n\nAll the piano keys of a chromatic scale are nailed down.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Tomas Schmit, Date unknown",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For more pieces consult",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THE\nFLUXUS PERFORMANCE WORKBOOK",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": ".",
      "links": []
